Here is a breakdown of how these components interact to create a cohesive compliance and productivity ecosystem.


1. The "AERO-GUARD Smart Button" (Integrated Client)
This is your User Acquisition & Retention Layer. It lives directly inside the agent’s workflow (GDS or Web-based IBE) to minimize friction.


•	Placement: A floating Action Button or Sidebar widget in the GDS (Smartpoint, Sabre Red) or your agency’s mid-office booking engine.

•	Core Functions:


