o	Live Case Resolution: A ticketing system where agents can request manual overrides or clarifications on complex fare rules.

o	Audit Logs: A permanent record of who changed what in a PNR, essential for IATA compliance and financial liability protection.

•	KPI Tracking: Average Response Time (ART) and "First-Time Right" booking rates.

3. The AERO-GUARD Agency Portal (Management)
This is your Decision-Support & Revenue Layer. It transforms raw booking data into actionable business intelligence for agency owners.


•	Primary Users: Agency Managers, Finance Departments, and Corporate Account Managers.

•	Core Functions:


o	Performance Analytics: Visual dashboards tracking booking volume, top destinations, leakage rates (out-of-policy bookings), and agent productivity.

o	Industry News/Alerts: A curated feed of airline debit memo (ADM) warnings, visa policy changes, and GDS downtime notifications.

o	Configuration Hub: Where managers set custom corporate travel policies (e.g., "Restrict economy class on flights over 6 hours").

o	Financial Reporting: Automated reports on potential savings from policy compliance vs. actual spend.

